### Purpose of the Document

This document summarises the results of manual testing performed on the Vivi.lv website. It provides an overview of test execution, test results, and identified defects.
The testing was performed according to the scope and approach defined in the Test Strategy.
All identified defects were documented and registered in Jira, including their descriptions, actual results, and relevant evidence.

### Execution Notes

* Testing start date: 04.08.2026
* Testing end date: 31.10.2026
* Main defects: Testing revealed several issues, including missing validation and feedback messages, incorrect language display, unavailable train information, problems with contact form submission and train search, as well as weaknesses in session management and sign-in security.
* Reasons for blocked or unexecuted tests: Tests could not be completed due to unavailable test data (discount card), restricted security testing permissions, and unavailable Favourite Routes functionality in the user interface.

