### Conclusion and Recommendations

Manual testing of the Vivi.lv website identified defects affecting functionality, validation, language localisation, and session management. Some tests could not be completed due to missing test data, unavailable functionality, and restricted permissions.
All identified defects were registered in Jira.

Recommendations:
* Resolve the identified defects and retest the affected functionality.
* Complete blocked tests when the necessary conditions are available.
